  "description": "Orchard Core module that stores and manages per-tenant Pendo integration settings\n      via Orchard Core's ISiteService. Ships a single built-in Pendo snippet shared by all\n      tenants and provides an admin UI for enabling Pendo for front-end and admin areas.",
  "id": "GovBuilt.Pendo",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-11-11T18:22:26.707Z",
  "licenseExpression": "MIT",
  "licenseUrl": "https://licenses.nuget.org/MIT",
