  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 30884,
  "published": "2026-11-11T18:07:27.023Z",
  "releaseNotes": "2.1.0:\n      - Changed: The Pendo script is now built into the module and shared by all tenants; it is no longer editable per tenant.\n      - Removed: Pendo Script textarea from the admin settings page. Only the Enable For Admin / Enable For Resident toggles remain.\n      2.0.4:\n      - Added: {{SiteName}} token that emits the site name from Site Settings (wrap in quotes, e.g. '{{SiteName}}').\n      - Removed: {{UserRolesJson}} token. Use '{{UserRoles}}' instead; scripts still using {{UserRolesJson}} must be updated.\n      - Updated: Admin settings hint and sample snippet document the new token.",
